"definir :c:member:`PyConfig.base_executable`."

#: ../../c-api/init_config.rst:2316
msgid ""
":c:member:`~PyConfig.prefix`, and :c:member:`~PyConfig.exec_prefix`, are now "
"set to the ``pyvenv.cfg`` directory. This was previously done "
"by :mod:`site`, therefore affected by :option:`-S`."
msgstr ""
"Os campos :c:member:`~PyConfig.prefix` e :c:member:`~PyConfig.exec_prefix` "
"passam a estar definidos para o diretório do ``pyvenv.cfg``. Anteriormente, "
"esta operação era executada por :mod:`site`, sendo, portanto, afetada "
